# Sync module (contracts/openapi/sync.yaml). A till syncs with its device token: register a device bound to the
# register (iam.http) and get its token (auth.http, client credentials of device-<id>) into deviceToken.

### Everything a till needs to work offline (SYN-02)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sync/bootstrap
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
Device-Time: 2026-11-25T09:00:00Z

> {%
client.global.set("cursors", Object.entries(response.body.datasets)
    .map(([name, set]) => name + ":" + set.version).join(","));
%}

### What changed since (SYN-03)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sync/changes?cursors={{cursors}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

### An offline shift, a bill and its close, in order (SYN-04; the record id is the idempotency key, SYN-05)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sync/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Device-Time: 2026-11-25T18:00:00Z

{"records": [
  {"type": "SHIFT_OPEN", "id": "0193e100-0000-7000-8000-000000000001", "payload": {"openedAt": "2026-11-25T08:00:00Z"}},
  {"type": "BILL", "id": "0193e100-0000-7000-8000-000000000002",
   "dependsOn": ["0193e100-0000-7000-8000-000000000001"],
   "payload": {"id": "0193e100-0000-7000-8000-000000000002", "number": "R1-000101",
               "shiftId": "0193e100-0000-7000-8000-000000000001", "channel": "RETAIL",
               "lines": [{"id": "0193e100-0000-7000-8000-000000000003", "variantId": "{{eggVariantId}}",
                          "packagingUnitId": "{{eggPieceUnitId}}", "qty": "10", "unitPrice": "55.00"}],
               "tenders": [{"id": "0193e100-0000-7000-8000-000000000004", "method": "CASH", "amount": "550.00",
                            "tendered": "1000.00"}],
               "totals": {"subtotal": "550.00", "discountTotal": "0.00", "taxTotal": "0.00", "grandTotal": "550.00"},
               "completedAt": "2026-11-25T10:15:00Z"}},
  {"type": "SHIFT_CLOSE", "id": "0193e100-0000-7000-8000-000000000005",
   "dependsOn": ["0193e100-0000-7000-8000-000000000001"],
   "payload": {"shiftId": "0193e100-0000-7000-8000-000000000001", "closedAt": "2026-11-25T18:00:00Z"}}
]}

### The till's sync status: clock skew, flags, missing bill numbers (SYN-06, SYN-07)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sync/status
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
